					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1596175#post-2455860</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1596175/xiupania#post-2455860</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 12 Feb 2016 07:42:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>psul</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2156983</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is so good that I almost hope we don't see more of this format - having any kind of formal structure would undermine the feeling of initial disorientation and subsequent sense of playing catch-up that makes this effectively dream-like. There is enough in the concepts here to grasp, but they are delightfully slippery. And every time it starts to feel like solid ground under foot, you introduce a new angle or perspective. Terrifically well written.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1596175#post-2455859</guid>
