					<![CDATA[
						 <p>God damn. This was weird, hilarious, terrifying, and all other sorts of emotions rolled into one internet dreamscape hybrid. I liked this alot especially for the following points:</p> <ul> <li>The formatting is gorgeous and flowed from one piece to the next seamlessly.</li> <li>Qi Shao is very much the stuff of nightmares, and is going to be a neat villian if that is how you intend to use the character.</li> <li>This is an example of excellent world building.</li> </ul> <p>Overall +1.</p> <p>Now if you don't mind, I think its time to collect my waffles and bacon.</p> 
				 	]]>
